WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.670
- [Kelly] I wanna remind everyone
of something that you said

00:00:02.670 --> 00:00:04.080
the last time I did see you.

00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:05.845
So let's just see this tape.

00:00:05.845 --> 00:00:09.618
- What is one thing you
like to do post-COVID?

00:00:09.618 --> 00:00:10.451
- I have a list.
(Kelly chuckles)

00:00:10.451 --> 00:00:11.700
- A fun thing? A fun thing?

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:12.810
- Yes.
- I don't know,

00:00:12.810 --> 00:00:15.510
maybe go have a martini
and some french fries.

00:00:15.510 --> 00:00:17.190
- Yes!
(Jill laughs)

00:00:17.190 --> 00:00:18.565
I knew I loved you.

00:00:18.565 --> 00:00:21.108
(audience cheering and applauding)

00:00:21.108 --> 00:00:25.960
If I didn't already like
you, that brought you over.

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:28.200
I just like to make people
feel comfortable here.

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:30.960
So for you, I thought I'd go ahead

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:32.393
and bring out some
martinis and some fries.

00:00:32.393 --> 00:00:35.393
(audience cheering)

00:00:37.537 --> 00:00:40.544
Look at you carrying that
so carefully, Justin.

00:00:40.544 --> 00:00:41.380
- Oh my goodness!

00:00:41.380 --> 00:00:43.740
- Okay, you take one, I'll take one.

00:00:43.740 --> 00:00:44.880
- Okay.
- Fine, fine.

00:00:44.880 --> 00:00:46.320
I don't know if we're supposed
to move it from the plate

00:00:46.320 --> 00:00:47.790
but I did 'cause I gotta get there Justin,

00:00:47.790 --> 00:00:49.055
you put that drink real far from me.

00:00:49.055 --> 00:00:50.400
(everyone laughs)

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:52.860
It's like he is there like
they know I don't drink much

00:00:52.860 --> 00:00:53.819
so they're like, "Sip on it."

00:00:53.819 --> 00:00:54.652
- [Jill] Here we are day drinking. Uh-oh.

00:00:54.652 --> 00:00:55.860
- Yeah, day drinking.

00:00:55.860 --> 00:00:56.693
Cheers!
- Cheers!

00:00:56.693 --> 00:01:00.750
- Oh and cheers because,
you're soon to have a wedding

00:01:00.750 --> 00:01:02.070
also in the White House.

00:01:02.070 --> 00:01:02.903
- Yeah.

00:01:02.903 --> 00:01:05.400
So yes I'm having a we--
We are having a wedding.

00:01:05.400 --> 00:01:09.091
It's my granddaughter,
my oldest granddaughter.

00:01:09.091 --> 00:01:09.990
(audience applauding)

00:01:09.990 --> 00:01:10.970
Thank you.

00:01:10.970 --> 00:01:13.411
- Just so you know, that's real.

00:01:13.411 --> 00:01:14.919
- [Jill] Mm!

00:01:14.919 --> 00:01:16.260
Oh yes, it is.

00:01:16.260 --> 00:01:17.093
- Yes it is.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:20.590
I took a sip and I was like,
"It ain't watered down, ma'am."

00:01:20.590 --> 00:01:21.441
(Jill laughs)

00:01:21.441 --> 00:01:23.370
We're just gonna set that right there.

00:01:23.370 --> 00:01:25.110
I didn't get a ton of sleep.

00:01:25.110 --> 00:01:26.670
So that's exciting at
the White House, wow.

00:01:26.670 --> 00:01:28.200
- It is. You know, it's so special.

00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:30.810
I have four granddaughters, two grandsons

00:01:30.810 --> 00:01:34.620
and I think that's one of the
most special relationships

00:01:34.620 --> 00:01:37.225
that I have in my life is to be a nana.

00:01:37.225 --> 00:01:41.100
And it's just so special to
watch, her name is Naomi,

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:44.460
to see her really planning her
wedding, making her choices

00:01:44.460 --> 00:01:47.910
becoming, you know,
just coming into her own

00:01:47.910 --> 00:01:49.290
and she's just so beautiful.

00:01:49.290 --> 00:01:52.080
So I can't wait 'til all
of you see her as a bride.

00:01:52.080 --> 00:01:53.922
- Oh, and what a cool venue for a wedding.

00:01:53.922 --> 00:01:54.790
(Jill laughs)

00:01:54.790 --> 00:01:55.940
- [Jill] Yeah.
- Yeah.

